     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=The%20serpent%27s%20jaws%20clamped,on%20nothing%20but%20clouds.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=We%20have%20to%20fight,it%20harm%20the%20people."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The last Valkyrie squad drew Koma toward the right Omenpath, and Avtyr caught Niko and flew down into the battle as Valkyries followed.",
    "cites": [
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e9",
     "aim-through-target-2021-01-15-e11"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=THERE%21%22%20Niko%20shouted%2C%20raising%20their%20left%20fist.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aim-through-target-2021-01-15#:~:text=Avtyr%27s%20hand%20clamped%20around%20their%20wrist."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Tibalt later cut open a doorway to Starnheim with the Sword of the Realms and unleashed Koma on the Valkyries.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-3-saga-tibalt-2021-01-20-e7"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-saga-tibalt-2021-01-20#:~:text=he%20cut%20open%20a,up%20for%20lost%20time"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Ranar realized the Valkyries had judged him to Istfell instead of Starnheim.",
    "cites": [
     "direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29-e2"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/direction-purpose-honor-glory-2021-01-29#:~:text=Without%20horror%2C%20he%20realized,an%20afterlife%20unexpected%3A%20Istfell."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "After Koma dove into the Karfell rift, Valkyries poured out of its own rift to attack the demons.",
